  "decisions": [
    "Admit nonempty ordinary property groups with visibility/static/readonly flags 0/1/2/4/8/9/10/12/64/65/66/68/72/73/74/76. Delegate names/types/defaults and invalid readonly diagnostics to the existing compiler; attributes/hooks/promotion/asymmetric setters/final properties remain refused by this gate.",
